{"seq":4,"slug":"physical-chemistry","title":"物理化学","stage":"DONE","category":"chemistry","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry","rating":{"composite":3.99,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"物理化学\">物理化学</h1><p>化学这门学科里，真正把「现象」变成「可预测规律」的分支是物理化学：它用热力学回答反应能不能发生、进行到哪里，用动力学回答多快、沿什么路径，用量子化学回答分子为什么长成那个样子，再用光谱学把前面三个理论放到实验台上检验。本 hub 的写作目标是让读者带着物理图像和定量工具离开，而不是背下一堆公式——每个公式都会给出它的来历、适用边界和失效时的样子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位与兄弟分工边界\">定位与兄弟分工边界</h2><p>52_chemistry 下与「物理化学」最容易混淆的几个 hub，分工边界如下。判断标准很简单：如果问题只需要定性概念，去普通化学；如果要算平衡位置、速率常数或能级，留在本 hub。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>它负责什么</th>\n<th>本 hub 不做什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1_general-chemistry</td>\n<td>化学平衡、酸碱、氧化还原的<strong>概念导论</strong>，面向第一次接触</td>\n<td>不重复平衡常数的入门定义，直接从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G^\\circ = -RT\\ln K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的热力学来源讲起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9_electrochemistry</td>\n<td>电极过程动力学、双电层、电池工程</td>\n<td>本 hub 只讲电化学的<strong>热力学骨架</strong>（Nernst 方程、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>E</mi><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E^\\circ</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>），界面与电流问题归它</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6_analytical-chemistry</td>\n<td>仪器分析的<strong>方法学</strong>：样品处理、检出限、定量策略</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲光谱的<strong>物理原理</strong>（为什么分子会吸收某个频率），不讲操作规程与数据处理流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5_materials-chemistry</td>\n<td>材料合成与性能的应用视角</td>\n<td>本 hub 提供它所依赖的相图热力学与能带/轨道基础，但不做材料体系综述</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>普通化学：化学平衡、反应计量、基本热化学（能写出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 的表达式即可）</li>\n<li>微积分：偏导数、定积分、简单微分方程（一阶线性足够）</li>\n<li>大学物理：功与内能、电磁学基础、波动概念</li>\n<li>线性代数：矩阵与特征值（仅第 3 章量子化学需要）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>推荐顺序是<strong>热力学 → 化学动力学 → 量子化学 → 光谱学</strong>，这个顺序不是随意的：热力学先给出「终态判据」（<a href=\"thermodynamics/laws-of-thermodynamics\">热力学定律</a>、<a href=\"thermodynamics/gibbs-free-energy\">吉布斯自由能</a>）；动力学接着回答「到达终态的路径与速度」，其核心的过渡态理论恰好要用到热力学的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mo>‡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G^\\ddagger</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；量子化学再往深一层，解释势能面为什么长那样；光谱学最后登场，把量子能级变成可测量的实验信号。已有物理背景、只想补化学视角的读者，可以直接从第 3 章进入，遇到热力学概念时回头查第 1 章的<a href=\"thermodynamics/chemical-thermodynamics\">化学热力学应用</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><p>以下兄弟 hub 与本 hub 主题相邻，可作为下一步探索入口（本 hub 内容不依赖它们）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../general-chemistry/\">普通化学</a>：平衡与反应类型的定性基础，本 hub 的前置</li>\n<li><a href=\"../electrochemistry/\">电化学</a>：把本 hub 第 1 章的热力学骨架推进到电极界面与真实电池</li>\n<li><a href=\"../analytical-chemistry/\">分析化学</a>：把第 4 章的光谱原理变成日常定量分析工具</li>\n<li><a href=\"../materials-chemistry/\">材料化学</a>：相图、能带与缺陷化学的工程落点</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"thermodynamics","title":"热力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/thermodynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"laws-of-thermodynamics","title":"热力学定律与熵（Laws of Thermodynamics）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/thermodynamics/laws-of-thermodynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gibbs-free-energy","title":"吉布斯自由能与自发性判据（Gibbs Free Energy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/thermodynamics/gibbs-free-energy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chemical-thermodynamics","title":"化学热力学的定量应用（Chemical Thermodynamics in Practice）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/thermodynamics/chemical-thermodynamics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-kinetics","title":"化学动力学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/chemical-kinetics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rate-laws-mechanisms","title":"速率方程与反应机理（Rate Laws and Mechanisms）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/chemical-kinetics/rate-laws-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"transition-state-theory","title":"过渡态理论与活化参数（Transition State Theory）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/chemical-kinetics/transition-state-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"catalysis-surface","title":"催化与表面化学（Catalysis and Surface Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/chemical-kinetics/catalysis-surface"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-chemistry","title":"量子化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"schrodinger-equation","title":"薛定谔方程与量子化学基础（Schrödinger Equation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry/schrodinger-equation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-orbital-theory","title":"分子轨道理论（Molecular Orbital Theory）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry/molecular-orbital-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"computational-chemistry","title":"计算化学：方法阶梯与实战权衡（Computational Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry/computational-chemistry"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"spectroscopy","title":"光谱学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"uv-vis-fluorescence","title":"紫外-可见吸收与荧光光谱（UV-Vis and Fluorescence）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/uv-vis-fluorescence"},{"seq":2,"slug":"infrared-raman","title":"红外与拉曼光谱（Infrared and Raman Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/infrared-raman"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nmr-spectroscopy","title":"核磁共振波谱（NMR Spectroscopy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/physical-chemistry/spectroscopy/nmr-spectroscopy"}]}]}